# Lego Striker

## One-liner

A **2D side-view flick soccer** game in the Football Striker style. Flick Lego minifigures with your finger to kick the ball, dodge moving goalkeeper bars, and score on the opponent's goal in a turn-based casual match.

---

## Core Concept

| Element | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **Controls** | Touch & hold character → power gauge **oscillates (0→1→0)** → release at desired timing · drag finger **42px+** to aim · return to character after aiming to **cancel** |
| **Goal** | Score in the opponent's goal (right side) |
| **Mode** | Turn-based — simulate until the **ball stops** after a flick, then switch turns |
| **Opponent** | AI Lego team |
| **Win** | First team to 3 goals wins |
| **Display** | Game screen in **landscape** (optimized for side view) |

