## Player Aiming & Power (v1.3)

**Hold charging** + **direction aiming** — no pull-back required.

### Control Flow

1. **Touch & hold character** — select + start charging, show **kick-ready pose** + power UI
2. **Power** — gauge oscillates **0→1→0** on `CHARGE_CYCLE_MS` (≈2.2s) cycle; release at desired timing
3. **Direction** — **ball direction** shown by default on hold; finger **≥ `AIM_DIRECTION_MIN` (42px)** from character center switches to finger direction
4. **Shot** — release → flick character with current power & direction
5. **Cancel** — short tap (under `MIN_CHARGE_MS`) · gesture interrupted · **after aiming started**, return finger within **`CANCEL_AIM_RADIUS` (36px)** of character center and release

### Power Gauge UI (`PowerGauge`)

Rendered **above** characters and ball (not obscured).

```
        ╭─── outer power ring (r≈56) ───╮
        │  ○○○○○○  ← oscillating fill    │
        │   ╭─ cancel zone (r≈36) ─╮     │
        │   │    🧍 active        │     │
        │   ╰─────────────────────╯     │
        └─────────→→→ aim line+arrow ──┘  (length ≈145px)
```

| Element | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| Outer circular gauge | radius **56px** — ring fills by power ratio, SUPER zone in gold |
| Inner dashed circle | radius **36px** — cancel zone hint (pink **Cancel** on return after aiming) |
| Aim line | dashed max range + solid current power length + end **arrow** |
| SUPER | ratio ≥ `SUPER_POWER_RATIO` (0.82) → gold + "SUPER!" |

### Power & Aim Constants (`src/constants/game.ts`)

| Constant | Value | Description |
|----------|-------|-------------|
| `MAX_POWER` | 26 | Max shot speed |
| `CHARGE_CYCLE_MS` | 2200 | Power oscillation period (ms) |
| `MIN_CHARGE_MS` | 80 | Hold shorter than this → cancel |
| `CANCEL_AIM_RADIUS` | 36 | Cancel zone radius (only after aiming started) |
| `AIM_DIRECTION_MIN` | 42 | Min distance for finger-direction aim |
| `SUPER_POWER_RATIO` | 0.82 | Super power threshold |
| `SETTLE_THRESHOLD` | 0.4 | Shots below this power are ignored |

### Implementation Notes (v1.3)

- `src/utils/power.ts` — `computeOscillatingChargeRatio`, `computeAimPower`, `isAimCancelZone`
- `src/hooks/useChargeTick.ts` — re-render gauge animation while holding
- `src/hooks/useSoccerEngine.ts` — `aimStartTime`, `aimDraggedOut`, `onAimCancel`
- `src/components/PowerGauge.tsx` — circular gauge & aim line UI
- `game.tsx` — `Gesture.Pan` + `onFinalize` cancel handling

