| variant | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `legacy` | White base + black pentagon pattern (default) |
| `pl` | Premier League–style purple / magenta / blue geometry |
| `worldcup` | World Cup–style bold black panels + red / green / gold accents |

- Same collision radius & friction — **visual only**
- Ball preview thumbnails on home + tap-to-select UI

### Country Selection & Field Flag Watermark
- Select **representative country** on home (ISO code, e.g. `KR`, `BR`, `JP`)
- Initial **8–12 country** presets; expandable later
- Show selected flag as watermark in **bottom-left of your side** of the field

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                      │
│   🇰🇷 ← ~12–18% opacity, inside field │
│                                      │
│         (gameplay area)              │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘
```

| Property | Value (draft) |
|----------|---------------|
| Position | Inside field padding, bottom-left (player side) |
| Size | ~22% of field height |
| Opacity | `opacity` 0.12–0.18 (subtle on grass) |
