## v1.5 Feedback — Sound & Haptics

Audio & tactile feedback for immersion. **Sound assets & tone to be finalized before implementation** (see candidates below).

### Current State (haptics — partial)

| Event | Haptic | Location |
|-------|--------|----------|
| Flick (normal) | `Medium` impact | `useSoccerEngine` |
| Flick (SUPER) | `Success` notification | `useSoccerEngine` |
| Goal (your score) | `Success` notification | `useSoccerEngine` |
| Goal (opponent score) | `Warning` notification | `useSoccerEngine` |
| Save (GK bar) | `Heavy` impact | `useSoccerEngine` |
| Cancel (return after aim) | `Light` impact | `useSoccerEngine` |
| Victory (result screen) | `Success` notification | `result.tsx` |

- **Sound**: not implemented
- **Settings UI** (mute / haptics off): not implemented

### Haptic Extensions (v1.5)

| Event | Suggested pattern | Intensity |
|-------|-------------------|-----------|
| Character select (touch) | `Light` impact | light |
| Ball ↔ character kick | `Rigid` / `Medium` (power-scaled) | medium–strong |
| Ball ↔ wall/character bounce | `Soft` impact | light (cooldown to prevent spam) |
| Turn change | `Light` impact | light |
| Defeat (result screen) | `Error` notification | medium |

- Keep `expo-haptics`; **cooldown** (≈80ms) on rapid collisions to prevent haptic spam
- **Haptics ON/OFF** on home or settings (`AsyncStorage`)

### Sound Candidates (for review)

Short, upbeat tones suited to casual turn-based play. Not overwhelming; repeatable without annoyance.

| ID | Event | Feel / reference | Priority |
|----|-------|------------------|----------|
| `kick` | Character hits ball | Short **thwack/kick** (table soccer / futsal, 0.1–0.2s) | ★★★ |
| `flick` | Finger release | Light **swing/whoosh** (only if no ball contact, optional) | ★★ |
| `super` | SUPER power shot | `kick` + low **boost/impact** | ★★ |
| `wall` | Ball ↔ field wall | Small **tap** (low volume) | ★★ |
| `save` | GK bar save | **Glove/block** + short metallic tap | ★★★ |
| `goal` | Your team scores | **Net swish** + short cheer (≤0.5s) | ★★★ |
| `goal_against` | Opponent scores | Net sound + **low groan** or muted effect | ★★ |
| `whistle` | Kickoff / turn start | Short **whistle** (optional, skip if too much) | ★ |
| `ui_tap` | Button / menu | Soft **click/pop** | ★★ |
| `win` / `lose` | Match end | Short **fanfare** / **downbeat** (result screen) | ★★ |

**Tone direction (pick one before finalizing)**

1. **Arcade minimal** — synthetic SFX, fits Lego/neon UI (recommended)
2. **Futsal real** — recorded kick/net sounds, can feel heavier
3. **Lego tone** — plastic click/snap feel, brand consistency

- BGM is **out of scope** for v1.5 (stadium ambient option in v2+ if needed)
- Assets: `assets/sounds/*.mp3` or `.wav` (short samples, 44.1kHz mono recommended)
- Library: **`expo-audio`** (SDK 57) — `useAudioPlayer` / preload pool

### Implementation Notes
- `src/audio/sounds.ts` — event ID → file mapping, volume & cooldown
- `src/hooks/useGameFeedback.ts` — unified sound + haptic API (`playKick()`, `playGoal()`, etc.)
- `Preferences`: `soundEnabled`, `hapticsEnabled` → `storage.ts`
- UI: home bottom or settings toggles (🔊 / 📳)

